    """ For a given list of input numbers, calculate Mean Square Deviation
    around the mean of this dataset.
    Mean Square Deviation is the average squared difference
    between each element and the mean:
    MSD = average (x - x_mean)^2
    """
    mean = sum(numbers)/len(numbers)
    return sum([(num-mean)**2 for num in numbers])/len(numbers)

